{"3701160": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sagittarius: The Lost and Cursed", "steam_appid": 3701160, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some stories were never meant to be told. But you’re the one who’s going to uncover this one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sagittarius: The Lost and Cursed</strong> is an indie horror game that lets you experience elements of survival, psychological horror and puzzle solving. Here every step might be your last, and every whisper is a warning. The disappearances in the local forest? Just the beginning. This is a curse. A curse that’s still alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701160/extras/5a97a70de72739e68278f4caff02917b.poster.avif?t=1758297816\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701160/extras/5a97a70de72739e68278f4caff02917b.webm?t=1758297816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701160/extras/5a97a70de72739e68278f4caff02917b.mp4?t=1758297816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your resources wisely. Save your stamina. Don’t waste your flashlight. But above all, keep your stress under control. Just try to survive, alright?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701160/extras/44618e259976f0eb6e3153b30d790db3.poster.avif?t=1758297816\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701160/extras/44618e259976f0eb6e3153b30d790db3.webm?t=1758297816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701160/extras/44618e259976f0eb6e3153b30d790db3.mp4?t=1758297816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Five levels - five different core mechanics. Face five unique nightmares. Each one worse than the last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701160/extras/207c0572107506e25cabf129fa944d0e.poster.avif?t=1758297816\" width=616 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701160/extras/207c0572107506e25cabf129fa944d0e.webm?t=1758297816\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3701160/extras/207c0572107506e25cabf129fa944d0e.mp4?t=1758297816\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find hidden items like Gray's Files to unravel the mystery behind the disappearances. Dig up the secrets the Gray family tried to bury.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you face what was never meant to be found?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Face your fears. Save your memories.</strong></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some stories were never meant to be told. But you’re the one who’s going to uncover this one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sagittarius: The Lost and Cursed</strong> is an indie horror game that lets you experience elements of survival, psychological horror and puzzle solving. Here every step might be your last, and every whisper is a warning. The disappearances in the local forest? Just the beginning. This is a curse. A curse that’s still alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video cla